\caption{Four-class RF accuracy (\%) across the $3 \times 3$ atlas, with d1--d3 three-class accuracy in parentheses (chance = 25\% / 33\%). Depth-0 recall exceeds 98\% in all cells. Bootstrap 95\% CI half-widths range 1.3--1.6\,pp across all cells.}
\label{tab:main_matrix}
\begin{tabular}{@{}lccc@{}}
